Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸去猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's on a hunting trip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好几天没回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应付得来几个小女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could take care of a few kitchen witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的法力来自恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get their power from demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在十字路口卖灵魂那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, selling your soul at the crossroads kind of deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是女巫养大的  却成了猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you guys were raised by a witch, but you're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海斯博士想了解一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Hess wants to know everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的"朋友"温家兄弟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about our "Friends" The Winchesters --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的同盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}their allies...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}...their habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆的头发怎么会那么油亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}how does Sam get his hair so shiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我看到大衮抓走了凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I saw Dagon had captured Kelly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得天使能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the angels could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该把这个毁掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to take this off the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在知道  这个孩子必须降生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know now that this child must be born
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并且保留他的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all of his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.78,0:01:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(怀俄明州  罗克河)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(山眠寄宿  日租&长期)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.53,0:01:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得按铃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to ring the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吓我一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可真娇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a delicate constitution you must have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戒指真好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that is a lovely ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.85,0:01:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.81,0:01:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it goes missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道该找谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll know who to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果需要  我可以清理你的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could cleanse your aura if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.97,0:01:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,似乎有点浑浊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks a little...muddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:01:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉让您久等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你是塔莎吗  -塔莎·贝恩斯  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you Tasha? - ‭Tasha Banes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我打过电话  -是的  我是安迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I called and... - Yes, right. I'm Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.42,0:02:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为您安排了楼上的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got you set up at the top of the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.14,0:02:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您为什么会来罗克河\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what brings you to Rock River?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公事还是私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Business or pleasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little bit of both.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(艾莉西娅  没事吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reveal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reveal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.35,0:02:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reveal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第12季第20集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超级马里奥开外挂的那一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Super Mario power-up crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个宝宝还没出生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That freaking baby isn't even born yet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就已经控制了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it sock puppeted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.78,0:04:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小卡说他对小路西法有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass said that he had faith in Lucifer Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我也搞不懂  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look, this doesn't make any sense to me either, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我们还想找到小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we wanna have some shot at finding Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就得\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:05:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  尽量去从他的角度想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Uh, try and think like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  在此之前  如果小卡搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, I mean up until now, if Cass messed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他做错了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he did something wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他以为是出于正义的理由  我都理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he thought it was for the right reasons, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但昨晚  我看着他时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But last night, when I looked at him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不认得与我对视的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not recognize the guy staring back at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能修好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不是我的  -也不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not me. - ‭It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是妈妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be one of Mom's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:05:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道...我是艾莉西娅·贝恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I didn't know y-- Uh, it's Alicia Banes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾莉西娅  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alicia? Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.69,0:06:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-麦克斯和艾莉西娅吗  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like Max and Alicia? - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  玛丽给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sorry to, um... Uh, Mary gave me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好几个可以联络她的号码  我们觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}a couple different numbers to reach her, and we thought --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得玛丽可能会愿意帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Mary would be down to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我们打个援手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, be our backup on this, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说疯话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位  我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. It's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你们没事吧  -嗯  看你问谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, you okay? - Yeah, depends who you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈去追捕一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Mom was hunting this witch
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.73,0:06:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在怀俄明州到处杀人的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's killed people all over Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之  妈妈一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, anyway, Mom usually
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.97,0:06:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会跟我们报平安  但她失联了\N{\fnArial\fs30}checks in with us, but she's sort of disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.89,0:06:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  她才没失联\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. She did not disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是在忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.81,0:06:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  那么你们的妈妈的确不见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so -- so your mom is missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正要往怀俄明州罗克河去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way to Rock River, Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但麦克斯觉得我在小题大做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Max thinks I'm overreacting, but I --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你就是太夸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're being dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈没事的  别打扰他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom's fine. Stop bothering them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会有事的  没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we'll be okay. Uh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:06:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把地址发给我们  我们去跟你们碰头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, why don't you text us your address? We'll meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是什么  -我们回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They will what? - We'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.34,0:07:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么  小卡怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, man? What about Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  小卡丢了手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, Cass ditched his cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.75,0:07:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔迪给小卡和凯莉发了三州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Jody put an APB out for Cass and Kelly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全境通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}across three states.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到收到什么回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until that shakes something loose
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是找到了别的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we get some other break,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就只能干坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}all we're doing is -- is sitting here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿头撞墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}banging our heads against a brick wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out there. Let's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.31,0:07:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的妈妈去猎魔  一周没回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their mom's on a hunting trip and hasn't been home in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(拨打妈妈的手机)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行行好  把那玩意关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be a dear and shut that bloody thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是迪恩  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Dean. - And?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.09,0:08:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是玛丽  请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mary. Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, just wanted to let you know that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和萨姆  我们要去办个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}me and Sam, we're uh, we're heading out on a case
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟那对儿巫师双胞胎  麦克斯和艾莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}with those witch twins, uh, Max and Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回头把信息发给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'll text you the info, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.98,0:08:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道英国人让你忙得脚不着地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the Brits have got you running nonstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能帮忙  那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you can help out, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算你不能过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if you can't swing by,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能回个电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you call me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是发生了些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some stuff going down that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我有点承受不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of got me spun out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能跟你聊聊就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be good to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定觉得变成玛丽很好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it amuses you to take Mary's form,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.59,0:09:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你是觉得这会\N{\fnArial\fs30}or perhaps you believe it will inspire
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.47,0:09:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我不愿下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}a bit of hesitation on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会开口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个易形者杀了人  玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shifter has killed people, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它活该受折磨  这还只是个开头\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the very beginning of what it deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.61,0:09:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它肯说出它的家人在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it tells us where its family is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都会停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, then this will all stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你撒谎的时候  眼睛会抽动\N{\fnArial\fs30}That eye of yours twitches when you lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的眼睛老抽动\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eye twitches all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我完全了解你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I know all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们到了  什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, we're here. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的妈妈去抓一个"借力者"巫师了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mom was after a "borrower" witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.47,0:10:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是通过恶魔交易得到法力的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}So witch that gets their power from a demon deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那么你们追踪你们妈妈来到了这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you tracked your mom here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们又追踪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we tracked her
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到了镇上一家素食餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the only vegan restaurant in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.39,0:10:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们告诉了我们她住在了哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told us where she was staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.69,0:10:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到了酒保的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the bartender's phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.53,0:10:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.15,0:10:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那车还是那么美\N{\fnArial\fs30}that car is still major.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the tour?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-当然了  -来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Definitely. - ‭Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯觉得根本没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max isn't really feelin' this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  没发现呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hadn't noticed. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他总觉得他更了解妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always thinks he knows Mom better,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  那是因为他们都是天生巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's 'cause they're both natural witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不错嘛  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice. - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那是榴弹发射器吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that a grenade launcher? - Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  但这才是我们现在需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, uh, this is what we need right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀女巫的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witch killing bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢  魔法方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about you? Uh, with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说就像白噪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just kind of a lot of noise to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔法是他们的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic is definitely their thing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小时候  迪恩和我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was growing up, Dean and my dad
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一起猎魔  那是他们的纽带\N{\fnArial\fs30}had the same thing with hunting, that bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.94,0:11:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和玛丽呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about with Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.21,0:11:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她去查案  就失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she gets into a case and just sort of vanishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  玛丽是个好猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, Mary's a great hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她似乎不怎么喜欢拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, she doesn't seem like much of a hugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.39,0:12:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找你们妈妈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go find your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的车在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, her car's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人打算把它藏起来  这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no one's trying to hide it. That's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不奇怪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not weird. At all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.73,0:12:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  如果有情况  你们待在我们身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, anything happens, you guys stay behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alicia...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.80,0:12:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么需要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我们在找...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, please. We're, uh, we're looking for, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯  艾莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max? Alicia?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:14.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean Winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这位是伟大的塔莎·贝恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}meet the great Tasha Banes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们跟我说了你们不少好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids have told me very nice things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.64,0:13:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾莉西娅差不多逼他们来的  担心你有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alicia basically made them come just in case you were in peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.49,0:13:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本没这必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was unnecessary,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过还是感谢你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but very nice of you all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安迪  能给我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, can we get a couple rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和他们的朋友安排房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}for my children and their friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  这就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. It'll just be a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  你们去我屋等吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. You can wait in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have wine. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.51,0:13:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗克河是死路一条  很遗憾  这里没有巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Rock River's a dead end. No witches here, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为真是这里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought this was the place --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么不打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then why didn't you call us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打了好几通电话  发了好多短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called and texted a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我的手机一天没充电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, baby. My phone hasn't been charging all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我找到了个很棒的针灸医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but I did find a fantastic acupuncturist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-当然了  -当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course you did. - Of course you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to help with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我行的  -但你一向会在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I've got it. - No, but you always call
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎魔第四天打电话的  从无例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the fourth day of a hunt, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  我就是忘...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, babe, it just slipped my --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.41,0:14:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  请吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, do the honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.81,0:14:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好  -艾莉西娅  放点音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - ‭Alicia, put some music on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从那家素食餐厅点了吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ordered food from that vegan place,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不送餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no deliveries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我去拿吧  -我去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I can get it. - Oh, I'll grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们留下  聊聊天什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you guys stay, hang out, catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(待机)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说  我现在非常兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must say, I am pumping with adrenaline.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:15:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以找个僻静的地方  活动一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we could find some privacy and tire ourselves out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不像在旅馆那样偷偷摸摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not illicit motel sex, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.45,0:15:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得我们说好那是仅此一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember us agreeing that was a onetime thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.52,0:15:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we? Ah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯奇  你的折磨就是浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ketch, it was a waste of time, that little torture session.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指信息收集吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean the information gathering session?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但我们没得到任何情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we didn't get any intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个易形者根本不会背叛家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shifter was never gonna betray his family,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and still you --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候痛苦好使  有时候不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes pain works. Sometimes it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但告诉你折磨不是办法的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But anyone who tells you that torture is never the answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是自己没挨过刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}they haven't been under the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你很享受  因为刚刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you enjoyed it, because that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从未见过你的那一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never seen that side of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  玛丽  很遗憾  你不会成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, Mary, I'm sad to say that you won't become
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英国记录者的蟋蟀杰米尼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Jiminy Cricket of the British Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.99,0:15:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要一个良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need a conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说来老套  但我们坚定认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a trite idea, but we firmly believe
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了结果可以不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ends do justify the means.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次就不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.35,0:15:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  你这不还没走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, but look, you're still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你大可以打给米克·戴维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to call Mick Davies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他给我记过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have him write me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克不接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mick's not answering his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不再发邮件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his e-mails have stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被长老叫去伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you get called to London by the old men,
