Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.43,0:27:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a psychopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.40,0:27:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.67,0:27:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克太软弱  他不像我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick was weak. He wasn't one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.05,0:27:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候才能明白  我们会不惜一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will you realize that we will do whatever it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.55,0:27:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铲除这世间的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to rid this world of the things that go bump in the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.19,0:27:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是米克和你的儿子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that people like Mick and your sons
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.57,0:27:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}are incapable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.36,0:27:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别提我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk about my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.97,0:27:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:28:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我收拾他们的烂摊子有好几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been cleaning up after them for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.08,0:28:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我解决了那些他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took care of those federal agents
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.00,0:28:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不该留活口的联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}they stupidly allowed to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.79,0:28:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了一个被他们视为人类的灵力少女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed a psychic girl they thought was...human.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  他们太大意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, they're damn sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.27,0:28:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.06,0:28:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正派\N{\fnArial\fs30}decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.41,0:28:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国猎人完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end for the American Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.96,0:28:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的时代结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their time has passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.22,0:28:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我可以保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.05,0:28:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你肯听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just play your part,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.82,0:28:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你乖乖配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you play nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.23,0:28:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从不会乖乖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.51,0:28:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打够了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.93,0:28:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天使铁莲花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those Enochian brass knuckles
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.59,0:28:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只对天使有用  很遗憾  我不是天...\N{\fnArial\fs30}only work on angels. And sadly, I'm not an --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.29,0:29:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,铁莲花就是铁莲花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brass knuckles are brass knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.36,0:29:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.46,0:29:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不  我觉得他真...  -你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}- No, I think he's really - Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.36,0:29:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.25,0:29:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我妈妈怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.13,0:29:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-麦克斯  你干什么  -等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Max! What are you - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.80,0:29:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.59,0:29:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你干什么  -放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.69,0:29:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那不是你妈妈  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not your mom. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.59,0:29:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking -- Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.67,0:29:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.84,0:29:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯  怎么了  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, what is wrong, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别  你不是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't! Don't. You are not my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.73,0:29:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-麦克斯  -我不知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Max - ‭I don't know what kind of thing you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.52,0:29:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you are not my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.74,0:29:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.70,0:29:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现形  马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reveal. Now! ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.78,0:29:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reveal!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.63,0:29:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走廊尽头的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The...the room, end of the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.88,0:29:57.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最顶楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top of the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.01,0:30:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.69,0:30:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.90,0:30:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.04,0:30:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.75,0:30:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.48,0:30:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有人想睡觉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are trying to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  女士  玩乐时间结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, lady, craft time's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.74,0:30:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.97,0:30:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  这魔法是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, this magic, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.01,0:30:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.93,0:30:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我多幸运啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How lucky am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.85,0:31:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么厉害的巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such an impressive witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.80,0:31:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你会接受上一个贱人不肯接受的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll take the deal the last bitch wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.57,0:31:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈  你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother...you killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.35,0:31:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.07,0:31:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把那些人怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.53,0:31:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来给你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我漫长的生命就要终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm reaching the end of my very long life,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.74,0:31:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个问题  因为我为法力出卖了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's a problem 'cause I sold my soul for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.34,0:31:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我去世  我的灵魂会下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when I pass, my soul goes to Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.57,0:31:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非  我能找人承担我的重担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I can find someone to take the burden,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.58,0:31:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接受我的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.74,0:31:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.58,0:32:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈找到我后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your mother found me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.11,0:32:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我意识到她是什么时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I realized what she was,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.73,0:32:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我提议教她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offered to teach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.12,0:32:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我提议给她我的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offered her my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.96,0:32:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但就算她要死了  也很粗鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even dying, she was rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.11,0:32:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.06,0:32:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把她做成了我的玩偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made her into one of my creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.96,0:32:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个玩偶有你妈妈全部的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doll has all of your mother's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.43,0:33:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那差不多就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's her. Mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.34,0:33:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.97,0:33:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里克  安迪  他们完全听从我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, Andy -- they do what I want, when I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.34,0:33:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我老了  我有自己的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm old. I like things a certain way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.74,0:33:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.35,0:33:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.80,0:33:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.61,0:33:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.72,0:33:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他们都会分崩离析\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, then all of them just fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.90,0:33:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的提议是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here's the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.44,0:33:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你接受我的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.49,0:33:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,承担我的重担  继承我的玩偶  你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take my burden, and my doll -- your mother --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.69,0:33:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能永远陪伴你和你妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}will stay with you and your sister forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.84,0:33:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个快乐的大家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one big happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.67,0:33:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯  不  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, no. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.44,0:33:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother is gone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.10,0:33:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然很糟糕  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's awful and it sucks... ...but that's
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.92,0:34:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.95,0:34:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成交吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.18,0:34:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.63,0:34:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.64,0:34:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.69,0:34:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.44,0:34:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交易就完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the deal is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.73,0:34:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.69,0:35:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.18,0:35:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撑住  放松  放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hold on. Just -- just take it easy. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.22,0:35:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找人救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.47,0:35:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你为什么  -麦克斯  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why did you... - Max, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.77,0:35:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.65,0:35:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那交易不是跟她做  是跟一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That deal wasn't with her. It was with a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.55,0:35:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你碰那魔法  你就会失去灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You even touch that magic, you lose your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.28,0:35:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.03,0:35:43.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.01,0:35:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别用劲  放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fight. Don't -- Shh, shh. Just take it easy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.04,0:35:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.54,0:35:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alicia?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.38,0:36:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}She, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.04,0:36:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alicia?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.18,0:36:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.66,0:36:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.23,0:36:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no. No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.61,0:36:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克斯  这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Hey, Max, um, this is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.70,0:36:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在可能还很震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you -- you're probably in shock right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.23,0:36:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's gonna pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.83,0:36:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后会很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it's gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.94,0:36:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本可以救她们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've saved them...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.48,0:36:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.50,0:36:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had just...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.88,0:37:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听进去艾莉西娅的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}taken Alicia seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.91,0:37:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了  别那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, you can't think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.20,0:37:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.88,0:37:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.63,0:37:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.33,0:37:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去买点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll, uh, go get some supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.71,0:37:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.59,0:37:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得火葬他们  麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta burn the bodies, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.81,0:37:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.43,0:37:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.15,0:37:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.97,0:37:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该由我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.03,0:37:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你俩走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.36,0:37:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-麦克斯  我们...  -拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Max, we would - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.00,0:37:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.38,0:37:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.30,0:38:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.39,0:38:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.67,0:38:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他看上去很好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he seemed super saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.91,0:38:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was watching them this
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.27,0:38:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有爱的一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}loving family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.60,0:38:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我们本该的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind we should've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.72,0:38:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  突然就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now just like that, it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.87,0:38:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你不能让麦克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you couldn't let Max
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.94,0:38:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出卖灵魂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}make some deal for his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.83,0:38:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我们经常为了救彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we do terrible things all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.19,0:38:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做很过分的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.70,0:38:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了家人这是应该的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's what you do for family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.91,0:38:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我凭什么阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.42,0:38:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很坚强  他不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's strong. He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.22,0:38:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我不太确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.47,0:38:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事  我觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.91,0:38:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得好像喝多了龙舌兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, I feel like I drank too much tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.07,0:39:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么  怎么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What...w-what did you do? What...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.26,0:39:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你受伤了吗  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you hurt? - No, no, no, no. I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.60,0:39:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回头再解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.35,0:39:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得走了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we gotta go now. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.79,0:39:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.44,0:39:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(妈妈)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.91,0:39:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我  抱歉我之前没接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's me. Sorry I couldn't pick up before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.79,0:40:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟凯奇猎魔去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been on a hunt with Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.09,0:40:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉我一直没有陪伴你和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I haven't been there for you and Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.01,0:40:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想陪你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wanna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.35,0:40:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.03,0:40:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是  需要完成这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...I need to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.21,0:40:12.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.39,0:40:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.29,0:40:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(妈妈)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.65,0:40:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.66,0:40:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.87,0:40:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  是妈妈  出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Hey, it's Mom. Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.22,0:40:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.62,0:40:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你醒来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good of you to rejoin me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.27,0:40:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电击枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Taser?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.28,0:40:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不太公平啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really a fair fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.75,0:40:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能像我希望的那么无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only you'd been as ruthless as I hoped,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.40,0:40:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果就会很好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this could have worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.39,0:41:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记住  玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.74,0:41:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给过你机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.50,0:41:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.91,0:41:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.91,0:41:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(迪恩)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.62,0:41:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.63,0:41:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.65,0:41:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们对你另有安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have other plans for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.66,0:41:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Mary...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.29,0:41:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's begin.

